        <mxCell id="bnote1" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;" value="Cross-module actions that update MULTIPLE collections:&#xa;• Creating an Accountability → marks assets &amp; workstation Assigned + assigned_to set on both&#xa;• Batch-transfer a workstation → auto-creates an Accountability record&#xa;• Assigning an asset to a workstation → also updates the active Accountability&#xa;• Closing an Accountability → assets &amp; workstation back to Available" vertex="1">
